# Cyndi parameters. Retuned 2026-09-16 on the 329-molecule test set with the
# corrected RMSD evaluator (see README, 'v4 Correctness + Performance Pass').
# Mutation 0.4 is the retuned optimum -- the old 0.1/0.2 recommendation was
# measured while polynomial mutation was dead code.
# MOGA_Max_Generation 300 is the fast setting (mean min-RMSD 0.586 A, 131 s);
# 1000 gives 0.508 A for 344 s. One generation = two children, so the search
# budget is roughly PopSize + 2*MaxNumGen -- generations matter, population
# size mostly sets the initial sample.
MOGA_Max_Conformers		100
MOGA_Num_Objectives		3
MOGA_Max_Generation		300
MOGA_Population_Size		100
MOGA_Max_Run		1
MOGA_Crossover_Probability		0.85
MOGA_Mutation_Probability		0.400000
MOGA_SBX		15 20
MOGA_Epsilon_Quaternion		2 0.2 0.1 2
MOGA_Keep_Input_Conformer[Y/N]		N
MOGA_Optimize_Conformer[Y/N]		Y
MOGA_Energy_Cutoff		60
MOGA_RMSD_Scale_Factor		0.2
MOGA_Max_Opt_Iteration		20
MOGA_Max_Opt_Gradient		0.5
MOGA_Split_Output[Y/N]		N
MOGA_Random_Seed		0.42
